# Direct messages

The product label is «Сообщения». Do not rename the header envelope or the list heading to «Переписки». The trainer cabinet sidebar and the plain-user account sidebar both say «Мои сообщения». The admin sidebar stays «Сообщения».

The full file map and edit checklist are in `.cursor/skills/trenio-messages/SKILL.md`. Product behavior stays in `docs/TECH_SPEC.md` §4.6.

## Who may talk

- One open conversation per account and one published trainer or club profile. No user-to-user chat. Questions to the portal go to the admin account `trenioby`. That thread has no trainer card.
- A client starts a thread at `/account/messages`. A trainer or club stays in `/me/messages` for both client threads and threads they start with another profile. `/account/messages` redirects those roles to `/me/messages` and keeps the conversation id. Staff open `/admin/messages` on the «Переписки (N)» tab, every conversation on the site. «Жалобы (N)» is the second tab. Staff do not write in a thread unless they are a participant.
- Trainer cards and the profile block after reviews («Как со мной связаться») use icon links: a phone handset, Instagram, Telegram, and a direct message. There is no email icon. Instagram, Telegram, and the direct message open in a new tab. The handset is a `tel:` link and stays on this page. On the profile the formatted number sits beside the handset. Hide the direct icon when the slug is in `messaging.ownedSlugs`. A guest’s direct icon goes to login and returns to the same thread.
- The owner or staff may close a thread. A participant cannot hide or delete it. The row stays for both sides. It is removed for everyone only when an account is deleted.
- A blocked pair cannot send. A profile must be published. The portal admin is the exception: a new trainer account gets one welcome from the admin user `trenioby` (`trenioby@gmail.com`), and the same thread stays open for questions. There is no trainer profile and no `/trainers/trenioby` page. The database rejects that slug. Admin and superadmin accounts do not get that welcome. The letter text is the site setting `trainer_welcome`, edited at `/admin/site`.
- One user may message at most 10 different trainers per Europe/Minsk calendar day. The 11th is refused in a `CabinetNotice` popup. Repeating a trainer already messaged that day is allowed. Count the initiator's sent messages, not the owner's replies.

## Text and chrome

- Count visible graphemes with `reviewTextLength` after `sanitizeReviewHtml`. The initiator's first message is 1000. Later messages are 4000. Stored HTML may be 12000 (`messages_body_len`).
- The composer is one box: toolbar, field, then the counter and «Отправить» on the same row. A paperclip on that row attaches up to 9 files, each at most 2 MB: JPEG, PNG, WEBP, GIF, PDF, DOC, DOCX, XLS, XLSX. The bytes decide the type. Files stay in `data/message-files/` and are served only to someone who can read the thread (`/messages/files/{id}`). A photo also stores a JPEG preview. The bubble shows a 72px thumbnail, and a tap opens the full image on the same page with rotate-left and rotate-right. Client bubbles are turquoise and trainer bubbles are coral. The viewer’s own bubbles stay on the right. Ctrl+V or ⌘V pastes a screenshot into the draft. Enter inserts a line break. Ctrl+Enter or ⌘+Enter sends the text already visible in the field. A message may be attachments only.
- A participant reports the whole thread once, from «…» in the thread header and the menu item «Пожаловаться». The dialog asks for a reason and a comment (1000 graphemes). The client and the trainer each file their own row. The row is `message_reports`: `conversation_id`, `reporter_side` (`client` or `trainer`), Russian `reason`, and `comment`. `message_id` stays empty. A second report from the same person is a duplicate. Active admins get mail with the reason and comment, not the chat. Staff read the row at `/admin/messages`. Do not write the comment into `app_logs`.
- On a phone the list and the open thread are separate steps. The thread fills the screen under the sticky header, and «К списку» returns to the list. Do not auto-open the first row on a narrow screen.
- Emoji are written into the editor value (insert a text node, then dispatch `input`). The picker includes every skin tone and the vulgar group.
- The sender sees «Доставлено» after the server stores the message, and «Прочитано» when the other participant's `last_read_message_id` is at least that id. An unowned profile stays «Доставлено». Every conversation row, for every role, shows that same state of its latest message in the right corner: one check is delivered, two checks are read.
- The messages icon is an envelope. The reviews icon stays a speech bubble. Sidebar counts for favorites, reviews, and messages are small numbers. For every role the envelope, the avatar menu, and the cabinet sidebar share one unread total (`own + inbox`): messages someone else sent to this account that this account has not opened, including threads the trainer started. A message this account sent stays out of that total. On the staff list a row badge counts the same incoming unread, and only when this account is a participant. «Переписки (N)» stays the number of conversations. New reports stay on «Жалобы (N)» and are not that badge.
- The list is ordered by latest activity. On a wide screen the first visit with no conversation in the URL opens the first row. After the X hides the thread, the list stays as it is until a row is chosen. A row highlights on hover, and the open row stays highlighted. Leave `?trainer=` alone until that thread is ready.
- In a dialog the given name and surname are one line. Do not label the thread «Открыта» or «Закрыта». The composer uses 14px text on a wide screen and 16px on a phone, so the system keyboard does not zoom the page.
- The portrait is the published card photo when that account has one, otherwise the account photo. A published name opens `/trainers/{slug}` in a new tab and uses the same new-tab mark as the cabinet identity. A plain account name stays text. When the header shows the client, «Тренер: …» opens that thread's card in a new tab with the same mark.
- On a phone the thread slides in under the header on a white sheet. «К списку» and a swipe from the left edge return to the list. There are no previous or next arrows in that header: they covered the name, and the next thread is opened from the list. A wide screen still shows those arrows. The composer rises above the keyboard. Block and report stay in the «…» menu.
- On a wide screen the X hides the open thread. It does not mark the conversation closed and does not show «Открыть». The row stays in the list. The page does not open the first row again after that.
- Admin and superadmin cabinets use `.layout-staff` (1680px). Trainer and account cabinets stay on 1240px.

## Live updates

Poll every 5 seconds while the tab is visible (`MESSAGE_SCAN_MS`). Pause when `document.visibilityState` is `hidden`. Do not add WebSocket or SSE. A later self-hosted PartyKit keeps this schema.

Opening a thread pins the log to the bottom when the unread tail fits in the pane. When that tail is taller than the pane, scroll to the top of the oldest unread message so a long message starts at its first line. A message the viewer just sent still pins to the bottom. A staff reader who is not a participant stays at the bottom.

The message email goes only to a verified mailbox, and only when «Сообщения» is on. Telegram goes to either participant when that account has a chat id and has already opened the bot or the Mini App. The note has no message text. Phone notices stay on until the person turns off «На телефон» in cabinet settings (`users.push_messages`, default true). The same switch is the mail-style row in that settings card, and it wraps on a narrow screen. The browser still asks once, on the first tap, because the system permission needs a gesture. There is no separate opt-in strip. A phone that granted it, in the browser or the installed app, gets a push. Turning the switch off deletes that account's subscriptions. The Mini App uses the Telegram note instead, because that web view cannot show a system push. The staff report letter does not use that switch.

```ts
// wrong: raw HTML length, or the wide staff grid on a trainer page
if (input.body.length > 500) throw new Error("too long");

// right: visible characters, Russian AuthError, staff width only around /admin
if (reviewTextLength(html) > limit) {
  throw new AuthError("Первое сообщение тренеру — не длиннее 1000 символов.", "VALIDATION");
}
```

Server writes stay in `src/lib/messages/functions.ts` with `POST` and `requireAuthMiddleware`. `beforeLoad` is not the security boundary.
